    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>Contact with the magic of the Shadowfell gives you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Shadow Magic.</strong> Choose one level 1 spell from the Illusion or Necromancy school. You always have that spell and @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplInvisibili]{Invisibility} prepared, and you can cast each of them once without a spell slot, regaining that use when you finish a Long Rest; you can also cast them with spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Their spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-gKGi1ZXtfyJz7QJg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose for both spells the ability you increased with this feat.</p></section>",
